  "markscheme": {
    "html": "<section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"a\"><p><strong>a</strong></p><p>Ratio of the power per unit area radiated by a surface to that of a black body at the same temperature.</p>\n<p>[1 mark]</p></section><section class=\"markscheme-part\" data-label=\"b\"><p><strong>b</strong></p><p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"P = e\\\\sigma A T^4 \\\\Rightarrow T = \\\\left( \\\\dfrac{P}{e\\\\sigma A} \\\\right)^{1/4}\"></span></p>\n<p>Substitute: <span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T = \\\\left( \\\\dfrac{1.35 \\\\times 10^9}{0.80 \\\\cdot 5.67 \\\\times 10^{-8} \\\\cdot 5.00 \\\\times 10^6} \\\\right)^{1/4}\"></span></p>\n<p><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"T = 300,\\\\text{K}\"></span></p>\n<p>[1 mark] for formula</p>\n<p>[1 mark] for substitution</p>\n<p>[1 mark] for answer **</p></section>"
  },
  "paper": "paper_2",
  "question": {
